[c1] @urban-warrior 2025-03-08T13:47:25Z:
Thank you for reporting the issue. We have successfully reproduced it and are actively working on a patch to resolve it. You can expect this patch to be merged into the [main GIT branch](https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick), later today. As part of our commitment to quality, this fix will also be included in the upcoming [beta releases of ImageMagick](https://imagemagick.org/archive/beta/) by tomorrow. Your patience and feedback are greatly appreciated.

---

